            "speakerId": 20114,
            "speakerName": "Ancient Tablet",
            "text": "\"At Tianqiu Valley the adepti's ancient trail grows cold, I fall down and weep at the ruins I see. Though defeated is mighty Azhdaha of old, there's no restoring this past land of beauty.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
